  {
   "id": "corner-kitchen-fast-food-simulator-326454@major-2025-03-17",
   "gameId": "corner-kitchen-fast-food-simulator-326454",
   "displayName": "Corner Kitchen Small Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-17T19:08:05.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🍔 Corner Kitchen Small Update: Better Stats, Fewer Bugs, and More Control! 🍟",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone! We’ve been cooking up some improvements for Corner Kitchen: Fast Food Simulator, and we’re excited to share this latest update with you! Here’s what’s new:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔥 Improvements & New Features",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ End-of-Day Statistics Overhaul – Get a more detailed breakdown of your performance, earnings, and worker efficiency.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Worker Attendance Info & Call-In Feature – If your worker didn’t show up due to lack of funds, you’ll now see why. Plus, if you’ve got the money now, you can call them in!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ Sell Your Old Furniture & Paints – Mason’s Shop now buys back furniture and paints for half their original price. Time to clear out that storage!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "✅ 4K Resolution Support – Enjoy crispy visuals with full support for 4K displays.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🛠️ Bug Fixes & Adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Kitchen Glitch Fixed – Customers will no longer walk through your kitchen when exiting from the second floor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Fries Station Fixed – No more sneaky extra fries packs from multiple clicks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Hot Dog Vanishing Act Solved – Dismantling food shelves or the hot dog station? Hot dogs now fall into a container instead of disappearing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔹 Furniture Placement Issue Fixed – You can now properly place furniture against the left wall after unlocking the second section.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎵 QoL & Audio Updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎧 Radio Upgrade – Channels now switch automatically after a song ends, and you can skip tracks with a click instead of holding the button.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎤 Narrator Toggle – Don't want the narrator’s voice? Now you can disable it in the settings!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚙️ \"Run in Background\" Option Added – Let the game keep running when minimized, if you prefer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update brings better control, better visuals, and a smoother experience overall. Keep the feedback coming, and as always, thanks for supporting Corner Kitchen! 🏪🔥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in the kitchen,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👨‍🍳 The Corner Kitchen Dev Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
